ist across reboot, and have coherent configuration and behavioral evidence. The provider-wide node-restart protocol was completed successfully and independently corroborated by lifecycle observations.","limitations":["Behavioral testing used pwscore rather than an end-to-end password-change transaction. PAM integration was directly observed, so this is a minor evidence limitation rather than an unmet outcome."]}
